# Local build artifacts and VCS — never part of the image, and copying
# them into the build context needlessly bloats it (target/ alone routinely
# reaches multiple GB of incremental build state, which can exhaust disk
# space on the build host for no benefit: the builder stage runs its own
# `cargo build` from source inside the container).
target/
.git/
.github/

# Local-only config and secrets; never bake these into an image.
.env
*.env.local

# Editor/OS cruft.
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Documentation and scratch state not needed to build or run the binaries.
*.md
.claude/
